WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with knees soft or come to hands and knees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Exhale and gently tuck the pelvis.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale to return to neutral.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Repeat slowly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest.
